%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
### Paddle Collisions
We can significantly simplify the problem by considering only the left and right sides of each paddle. Thus, it effectively becomes a wall-collision problem.

!![1:]
In principle, if either `x-dist` or `y-dist` becomes negative, then we have a collision. No matter which direction the ball comes from, we __simply flip__ the x-component of its velocity.


%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
